 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Part (i)",
   "text": "**Review Q1 (i) The standard form of 5.2 × 10⁶ is:**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{(a) }52,000\\text{ (b) }520,000\\text{ (c) }5,200,000\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{(d) }52,000,000\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{Answer: (c) }\\mathbf{5,200,000}}\\text{ — Power is}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad +6\\to \\text{ move the decimal point }6\\text{ places}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{to the right: }5.2\\times 10^{6}=5,200,000.\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Part (ii)",
   "text": "**Review Q1 (ii) Scientific notation of 0.00034 is:**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{(a) 3.4 $\\times$ 10$^{3}$ (b) 3.4 $\\times$ 10⁻⁴ (c) 3.4 $\\times$}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{10⁴ (d) 3.4 $\\times$ 10⁻$^{3}$}\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{Answer: (b) 3.4 $\\times$ 10⁻⁴}}\\text{ — The point}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{hops }4\\text{ places to the right}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad (0.00034\\to 3.4),\\text{ so the power is }-4.\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 1
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Part (iii)",
   "text": "**Review Q1 (iii) The base of common logarithm is:**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{(a) }2\\text{ (b) }10\\text{ (c) }5\\text{ (d) e}\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{Answer: (b) }\\mathbf{10}}\\text{ — Common logarithm}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =\\text{ base }10\\text{ (base e is the natural log).}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 2
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Part (iv)",
   "text": "**Review Q1 (iv) log₂ 2³ = ______**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{(a) }1\\text{ (b) }2\\text{ (c) }5\\text{ (d) }3\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{Answer: (d) }\\mathbf{3}}\\text{ — }\\log_{b} b^{n}=n,\\text{ so}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{log₂ }2^{3}=3.\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 3
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "title": "Part (v)",
   "text": "**Review Q1 (v) log 100 = ______**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{(a) }2\\text{ (b) }3\\text{ (c) }10\\text{ (d) }1\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{Answer: (a) }\\mathbf{2}}\\text{ — }100=10^{2},\\text{ so log}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad 100=2.\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 4
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "title": "Part (vi)",
   "text": "**Review Q1 (vi) If log 2 = 0.3010, then log 200 is:**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{(a) }1.3010\\text{ (b) }0.6010\\text{ (c) }2.3010\\text{ (d)}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad 2.6010\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{Answer: (c) }\\mathbf{2.3010}}\\text{ — log }200=\\text{ log}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad (2\\times 100)=\\text{ log }2+\\text{ log }100=0.3010+\\\\[5pt]&\\quad 2=2.3010.\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 5
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "title": "Part (vii)",
   "text": "**Review Q1 (vii) log (0) = ______**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{(a) positive (b) negative (c) zero (d)}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{undefined}\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{Answer: (d) undefined}}\\text{ — No power}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{of }10\\text{ can ever give }0.\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 6
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "title": "Part (viii)",
   "text": "**Review Q1 (viii) log 10,000 =**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{(a) }2\\text{ (b) }3\\text{ (c) }4\\text{ (d) }5\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{Answer: (c) }\\mathbf{4}}\\text{ — 10,000 = 10⁴, so}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{log }10,000=4.\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 7
     },
